## Verify Installation

Verify that the command-line utility is available:

```bash
udunits2 -h
```

Verify the installed XML units database can be loaded:

```bash
udunits2
```

Verify a simple conversion:

```bash
udunits2 -H "1 m" -W "ft"
```

If all of the commands above complete successfully, UDUNITS-2 is installed correctly and ready to use.